  "description": "Doğduğun Ev Kaderindir (My Home My Destiny / منزلي) is a 2019 Turkish romantic drama based on a true story. Born into poverty and given up for adoption at age seven, Zeynep grows into an educated, beautiful young woman living a fairytale life — until her biological mother reappears, threatening to drag her back to the world she left behind. Two wounded souls, Zeynep and Mehdi, find themselves entangled in a love story shaped entirely by the homes that made them. Starring Demet Özdemir and İbrahim Çelikkol.",
